WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:03.128
Ten minutes to start!

00:00:04.045 --> 00:00:09.134
The showdown between Porco Rosso
and Donald Curtis is about to begin!

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:15.640
There's no rules. The first one
to run is a coward forever!

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:18.143
Shut up! We came here for a dogfight.

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:19.936
We're not here for a lecture!

00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:27.110
Shut up! Open your mouth and we shoot you!

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:38.538
A ten-ton bomb would be better.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:43.793
This fight decides the fate
of our beloved Miss Fio Piccolo...

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:45.545
who needs no introduction!

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:50.508
Know what I mean?
A big hand for Fio! Applaud!

00:00:52.635 --> 00:00:53.845
Get on with it!

00:00:53.928 --> 00:00:57.307
Quiet! There are formalities to observe!

00:00:58.016 --> 00:01:00.810
Both sides will place their wagers!

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:07.942
-Please sit down.
-Thank you.

00:01:08.818 --> 00:01:10.153
Put it down!

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:17.660
No complaints? All right, shake hands
and come out flying!

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:20.830
Forget it. I'll keep my hands clean.

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:25.710
That's not very friendly.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:28.838
We'll go straight to the church!

00:01:29.839 --> 00:01:33.927
Don't worry. My mother says
you can get used to anything.

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:42.310
-May we have a picture?
-We took a bath!

00:01:42.685 --> 00:01:44.312
Smile, everyone!

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:45.980
Smile!

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:47.524
Ready...

